Preserve the production GLM media policy through lazy preparation. Charge only
active fetch/decode/resize/patchification time, excluding admission and text-prefill
waits. Match the Python kit clip allocation before planning (16K ceiling, 32K
request total), and retain GLM image detail even with a low hint.

Python policy: Mia kit bf5f9452, patches/0050-glm-many-media.patch.

